</header><section id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec__head">
      <span class="sec__idx">01</span>
      <div>
        <h2 class="sec__title" id="services-title">What we do.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Earthworks, cartage, quarry supply and disposal - plant, operators and logistics handled from one place.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cap-grid">
      <article class="cap rv"><span class="cap__num">01</span><h3>Earthworks</h3><p>Bulk and detailed excavation, site cuts, pad prep, trenching and grading to finished levels.</p></article>
      <article class="cap rv"><span class="cap__num">02</span><h3>Cartage & Disposal</h3><p>Tipper and truck-and-dog cartage - spoil, VENM, demolition waste and contaminated material to licensed facilities.</p></article>
      <article class="cap rv"><span class="cap__num">03</span><h3>Quarry Product Supply</h3><p>Road base, drainage aggregate, sand, crusher dust and decorative gravel - delivered to site.</p></article>
      <article class="cap rv"><span class="cap__num">04</span><h3>Tight-Access Excavation</h3><p>Compact machines for restricted sites, rear yards and basement digs where full-size plant won't fit.</p></article>
      <article class="cap rv"><span class="cap__num">05</span><h3>VENM & Demolition Waste</h3><p>Virgin excavated natural material and mixed demolition streams - classified, loaded and disposed legally.</p></article>
      <article class="cap rv"><span class="cap__num">06</span><h3>Site Clearing</h3><p>Vegetation removal, strip-topsoil, demolition rubble clear-out and site prep for following trades.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

